{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09355","headline":"雨夜宿清都观 · 韦应物","name":"雨夜宿清都观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵飙动阊阖，微雨洒瑶林。\n复此新秋夜，高阁正沈沈。\n旷岁恨殊迹，兹夕一披襟。\n洞户含凉气，网轩构层阴。\n况自展良友，芳罇遂盈斟。\n适悟委前妄，清言怡道心。\n岂恋腰间绶，如彼笼中禽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}